fixture jump_variable_height
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump: variable height; s15 "the release feels like a decision, not a cut" (each extra frame held adds height)
room test/flat
frames 50
input
  0..9 jump
end
expect
  at 9 jump_cut=0
  at 10 jump_cut=1
  mark apex 0..49 vy>=0
  # Held 10 frames: between the tap (77.9 u) and the full jump (176 u).
  at apex-1 y>=413u y<=416u
end
